### KVDB unhealthy
The cluster sees the Portworx key-value database as unhealthy. Volume operations (create, attach, failover) fail until it recovers.

#### Check first
1. [Portworx - Cluster overview](/#/dashboards/urn:stackpack:portworx:dashboard:cluster-overview) → **KVDB health per node** and **KVDB watch latency**.
2. `kubectl -n <portworx-namespace> exec <px-cluster-pod> -c portworx -- /opt/pwx/bin/pxctl service kvdb members`: are all members healthy and is there a leader?

#### Fix
Restore the failed KVDB member or its disk, or the network between members.
